  "scope": "Original mount topology transactions, shared pathname observers and original fs_struct root replacement. Task namespace membership remains a separate subsystem.",
  "implementation": [
    "Calling workers use the original namespace transaction mutex and shared graph; contention retains FileWork, subscribes to original readiness and releases its execution slot.",
    "Weak immutable lookup-index caches refresh only on actual index publication; no cache keeps detached mounts or overlay layers alive.",
    "Pivot replaces matching root/cwd references through a weak registry of original fs_structs; fork registration synchronizes with replacement, while open directory FDs retain their meaning.",
    "No new coordinator/resource thread, polling message bus, guest data barrier or unsafe implementation was introduced."
  ],
